  "description": "Welcome to the world of Delcato, where people have powers and embody animals.\n\n\"My deepest apologies! I'm breaking things off!\" the man sobs... but who is he? Wait, am I Serena Ethereol?!\nSerena is an unlucky duck, dumped three times while engaged, and just a side character in the original novel. It couldn't get any worse. But then, the male lead wants to get engaged. Not again... I just want a peaceful life! How can I shake him off...\n\nWill she duck out of this marriage? Or take another quack at love?\n\n(Source: PocketComics)",
